{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19587","headline":"中书相公任兵部侍郎日後阁植四松逾数年澣忝此官因献拙什 · 郑澣","name":"中书相公任兵部侍郎日後阁植四松逾数年澣忝此官因献拙什","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"丞相当时植，幽襟对此开。\n人知舟檝器，天假栋梁材。\n错落龙鳞出，䙰褷鹤翅回。\n重阴罗武库，细响静山台。\n得地公堂里，移根涧水隈。\n吴臣梦寐远，秦岳岁年摧。\n转觉飞缨缪，何因继组来。\n几寻珠履迹，愿比角弓培。\n栢悦犹依社，星高久照台。\n後凋应共操，无复问良媒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑澣","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19587.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19587","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}